Title: The Meter Room
Credit: Planning example

INT. APARTMENT BUILDING - METER ROOM - NIGHT #S01#

The hallway light clicks back on. Mariam pauses in the doorway. Bilal closes his fist around a borrowed key.

MARIAM
روشنی تو آ گئی۔ تم کہاں تھے؟

BILAL
بس، چابی واپس رکھنے آیا تھا۔

He puts the key between them on a shelf. Neither reaches for it.
